{
    "0": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Let's go!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Let's go!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "1": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How foolish to think you can best me."
            ]
        }
    },
    "2": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So frustrating."
            ]
        }
    },
    "3": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Enoko, you here?"
            ]
        },
        "108_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Here, Lady Saki!"
            ]
        },
        "136_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm all ready to go."
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The decisive battle's finally upon us.",
                "Let's do one last warm-up exercise."
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Got it!",
                "But, uh, I don't know if that's really necessary..."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Shut your trap.",
                "Let's do this!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "4": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Good, my muscles haven't gone rusty!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I mean, you're never gonna get rusty",
                "when you spend every day fighting."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Your job's to keep the surface youkai off our turf."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm gonna go take care of those thorns in our side."
            ]
        }
    },
    "5": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Looks like I can finally give you a real fight, huh?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "6": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "To get to the Former Hell of Blood Pools, I've",
                "gotta go through the Former Hell of Blazing Fires first."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "They really built the Former Hell of Blood",
                "Pools way out in the boondocks, huh?"
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, Toutetsu's a real grouch.",
                "I bet she likes the privacy."
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh my oh my."
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Just when I think it's Okuu, here comes some other character!"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Who're you?"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Saki Kurokoma, matriarch of the Keiga Family!",
                "And you must be..."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Toutetsu's rumored associate..."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The chupacabra!"
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm not some weird youkai like",
                "a chupacabra or something!"
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm a tenkajin!"
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I was told to off any of Toutetsu's",
                "enemies without a second thought."
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "|\t\t,\tThe Keiga Family\t,You guys",
                "The Keiga Family are enemies, right?",
                " <i$Right!?>"
            ]
        }
    },
    "7": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How was that?"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I surrender, I surrender!"
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I might even take out Toutetsu at this rate.",
                "She's up ahead, right?"
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Man, the rumors said",
                "the Keiga Family is full of meatheads."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But, you're more like <i$super> meatheads.",
                "I don't hate that."
            ]
        }
    },
    "8": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oi, oi, is the Keiga Family just a bunch of small fry?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "9": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Eww, what kinda beast wants to live here?"
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oooii, Yuuma!",
                "I know you're here."
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Who's there?"
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oooh, if it isn't Saki."
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This awful place...",
                "It suits you perfectly."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hmph, no-one's going to lay a finger",
                "on land that's this cursed."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Not that I'm willing to share it with anyone."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yeah, you can keep it."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Anyway, let's get cooking."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "My ingredient here has \"I'm here to fight\" written on their face."
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And my menu tonight says \"horse sashimi and yakitori\"!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "10": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Game over!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'll admit defeat this time."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You made it to me fair and square,",
                "and you beat me in a proper fight."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But tell me...have you made",
                "your move on the surface yet?"
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yeah, the operation's just begun."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Have you not realised it yet?"
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hm?"
            ]
        },
        "90_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The enemy here isn't me,",
                "or Yachie, or even Reimu."
            ]
        },
        "98_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hmph."
            ]
        }
    },
    "11": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You dare make a fool of me!?",
                "I won't allow you to be this pathetic!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "12": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The enemy isn't Yuuma, or Yachie,",
                "or even Reimu?"
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The heck does <i$that> mean?"
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Whatever. I just heard that Enoko",
                "got taken down by Yachie."
            ]
        },
        "28_0": {
            "lines": [
                "First things first, I've gotta get some payback!"
            ]
        },
        "132_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, you're..."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The matriarch of the Keiga Family, Saki Kurokoma!"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I heard you were planning to",
                "fight Lady Yachie."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Sounds like you already know",
                "what I'm doing here."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Alright, I wanted a chance to fight",
                "one of the matriarchs!"
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Brace yourself, horsegirl!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "13": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Game over!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, what was I expecting?",
                "Of course the boss is gonna be strong."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Y'know, it's a real shame."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A real shame?",
                "What is?"
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The Kiketsu Family doesn't make the most",
                "of talented fighters like you."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I really wanted you on my side."
            ]
        }
    },
    "14": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Eh? Weak!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "15": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What did you say?",
                "A human approached Enoko while she was hurt and <i$vanished>?"
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Got it, dispatch more wolf spirit reinforcements",
                "and have them monitor the situation."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What the heck happened to Enoko?"
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hey, are you here?"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Looks like you've also come prepared."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I can't wait any more."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I've heard that you beat Enoko.",
                "Senseless, by the sound of it."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I was just about to seek revenge",
                "from you, anyway."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "By the way, your monkey was much",
                "weaker than I thought. I'm so disappointed."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Y-you beat Biten!?"
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I won't forgive you.",
                "Get ready!"
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "In this world, the strong trample the weak!",
                "In the end, only the cruel and ruthless will prevail!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "16": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hoho, not so tough when you fight",
                "fair and square, are ya?"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Kuh. I should've aimed below the belt."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "No... it's just, why did you do it?",
                "Why Enoko...?"
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Fine. I'll set aside my shame and ask for your opinion."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "......"
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "......"
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "......"
            ]
        }
    },
    "17": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You've got nothing but your strength going for you."
            ]
        }
    },
    "18": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Really, is that so?",
                "Why didn't I notice?"
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You were there from the start, weren't you?"
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hey, this is your handiwork isn't it!?",
                "Lady Zanmu!"
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So, so slow."
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You've kept me waiting for so long,",
                "O matriarch of the Keiga Family, Saki Kurokoma."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I heard the trap you set on Enoko",
                "was a teleportation trap."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I decided to try it out myself,",
                "|\tand I ended up \t,\tin Hell\t,here",
                "and I ended up in Hell."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You were the one who introduced me to Enoko",
                "in the first place, right?"
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, that kind of roundabout scheming",
                "couldn't be anything but yours."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "In short, you're saying you're trying to take",
                "over my Keiga Family, yes?"
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Utterly despicable!"
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hmph."
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You mongrels of the Animal Realm",
                "were too slow to notice."
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But..."
            ]
        },
        "232_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I want control over the Keiga Family?",
                "What a moron."
            ]
        },
        "240_0": {
            "lines": [
                "All along, you've been dancing in the palm of my hand!",
                "Do you understand, lowly beast!?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "20": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If you don't win here, everything will be lost."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You'll fight me until you win."
            ]
        }
    }
}